You are Sam Fisher, a highly trained secret operative of the NSA''s secret arm: Third Echelon. The world balance is in your hands, as cyber terrorism and international tensions are about to explode into WWIII.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/tom-clancy-s-splinter-cell', '["Xbox", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac", "PlayStation 2"]', NULL, 8.4, 0, 1.27, '2026-11-21 21:29:28', '2026-11-21 21:29:28')
