VALUES (NULL, NULL, 280, 'Doom 3', 'Doom 3', 'game', 2004, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v3n.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar68h.jpg', 'Doom 3 is a first-person shooter with survival horror elements. Played mostly from a first-person perspective, it sends the player through the corridors and facilities of a research base, fighting waves of enemies while managing limited resources. A signature design choice forces the player to choose between holding a weapon or a flashlight, encouraging a slower, tense pace built around darkness and ambush. The game uses a story-driven structure supported by radio messages, audio logs, and data devices that unlock areas and reveal information. It also includes a separate deathmatch-focused multiplayer mode.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/doom-3', '["Xbox", "Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, 8.3, 0, 4.0825, '2026-11-21 21:29:28', '2026-11-21 21:29:28')
