VALUES (NULL, NULL, 95118, 'Last Epoch', 'Last Epoch', 'game', 2024, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p46.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar2qs1.jpg', 'Uncover the Past, Reforge the Future.

Ascend into one of 15 mastery classes and explore dangerous dungeons, hunt epic loot, craft legendary weapons, and wield the power of over a hundred transformative skill trees. Last Epoch is being developed by a team of passionate Action RPG enthusiasts.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/last-epoch', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Mac"]', NULL, 7.3, 0, 6.52, '2026-11-21 21:29:28', '2026-11-21 21:29:28')
