VALUES (NULL, NULL, 250904, 'Warhammer 40,000: Speed Freeks', 'Warhammer 40,000: Speed Freeks', 'game', 2025, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jl3.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar6224.jpg', 'Blaze into the high-Orktane mayhem of clashing Speedmobs, in adrenaline-fueled combat racing through the brutal Warhammer 40,000 universe! Drive scrappy vehicles loaded with bombastic weapons and powerful abilities to krump the opposing team!

Assemble your mob of dakka-spitting wagons, pushing their team to victory across multiple maps in this explosively unique take on the combat racing and shooter genres. Obliterate your Ork foes with kunnin’ strategies and brute force as your team speeds towards ultimate glory.

Are you looking for more speed and more dakka in your life? Look no further YA GITS!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/warhammer-40000-speed-freeks', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5"]', NULL, 7.0, 0, 9.02, '2026-11-21 21:29:28', '2026-11-21 21:29:28')
