VALUES (NULL, NULL, 6942, 'Condemned: Criminal Origins', 'Condemned: Criminal Origins', 'game', 2005, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eis.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar80z.jpg', 'Investigate crime scenes, collect evidence, and bring to light the murderers terrorizing the city as Detective Ethan Thomas. With danger lurking around every corner, you’ll need whatever weapons you can find to stay alive.

What twists the mind of an ordinary human into a serial killer? Assigned to the Serial Crimes Unit, Agent Ethan Thomas must answer this question, and bring the worst of society to justice. His solve rate is the best in the bureau....perhaps too good.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/condemned-criminal-origins', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox 360"]', NULL, 7.7, 0, 2.02, '2026-11-21 21:29:28', '2026-11-21 21:29:28')
