VALUES (NULL, NULL, 136512, 'Hood: Outlaws & Legends', 'Hood: Outlaws & Legends', 'game', 2021, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xss.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar7yd.jpg', 'In a violent, medieval world, outplay rival gangs in intense PvPvE multiplayer heists. Moving in stealth to steal treasures unseen or dominating through loud and brutal combat, only the best will escape with hard-earned riches.

The game ended service on February 18, 2025.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/hood-outlaws-and-legends', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 6.2, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-21 21:29:28', '2026-11-21 21:29:28')
