VALUES (NULL, NULL, 25638, 'Meadow', 'Meadow', 'game', 2016, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3he7.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/arlgk.jpg', 'Meadow is Might and Delight''s latest release; a massively multiplayer online sandbox that allows players to interact as animals would. Described as a "forum in games'' clothing", this online fable experience lets fans - old and new - come together and experience a peculiar world.

Unlike traditional titles from the Shelter franchise, in Meadow the more time spent embracing the gameplay features in the world, the more you receive. Owning any previous Shelter related title(s) or products will also unlock in-game content. The open landscape also provides ample room for exploration with new patches and additions promised.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/meadow', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, 7.5, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-21 21:29:28', '2026-11-21 21:29:28')
