VALUES (NULL, NULL, 99954, 'Warship Gunner 2', 'Warship Gunner 2', 'game', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Get Warship Gunner 2 is a strategy, simulation game. The game is set in 1939 of an alternate universe, and thus combines technology of this period in the real world with a variety of futuristic lasers and weapons. There are three story paths with different missions, story, and endings. The specific story path is chosen by the player''s actions.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/warship-gunner-2', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 9.01, '2026-11-21 21:29:28', '2026-11-21 21:29:28')
