VALUES (NULL, NULL, 214414, 'Where Winds Meet', 'Where Winds Meet', 'game', 2024, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/coauhs.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar390k.jpg', 'Where Winds Meet is a free-to-play wuxia action-adventure RPG set in China during the Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms period. Players take on the role of a wandering adventurer known as a youxia, wielding a variety of weapons including swords, spears, fans, and umbrellas, each paired with distinct martial arts styles. The open world spans multiple regions and supports both single-player and multiplayer modes, with cooperative dungeons, PvP arenas, and a range of casual activities. Combat combines light and heavy attacks, martial art skills, mystic arts, and defensive maneuvers like dodges, blocks, and deflects.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/where-winds-meet', '["Xbox Series X|S", "Android", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "PlayStation 5"]', NULL, 6.0, 0, 9.03, '2026-11-21 21:29:28', '2026-11-21 21:29:28')
