VALUES (NULL, NULL, 5082, 'Divinity: Original Sin', 'Divinity: Original Sin', 'game', 2014, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2axn.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/arhp5.jpg', 'Gather your party and get ready for a new, back-to-the-roots RPG adventure! Discuss your decisions with companions; fight foes in turn-based combat; explore an open world and interact with everything and everyone you see. Join up with a friend to play online in co-op and make your own adventures with the powerful RPG toolkit.

Divinity: Original Sin is a game that gives you a lot of freedom and plenty of gameplay mechanics to use or abuse. The game''s epic story may drive you toward your ultimate end-goal, but how you get there is entirely up to you.

Or up to you and a friend, because Divinity: Original Sin can be played completely cooperatively, and features both online and local drop-in/drop-out multiplayer. Great adventures become even greater when shared with a trusted comrade-in-arms!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/divinity-original-sin', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, 8.6, 0, 6.025, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-21 21:29:28')
